{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10342","headline":"酬庞十兵曹 · 高适","name":"酬庞十兵曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔游京华，自言生羽翼。\n怀书访知己，末路空相识。\n许国不成名，还家有慙色。\n托身从𤱶亩，浪迹初自得\n雨泽感天时，耕耘忘帝力。\n同人洛阳至，问我睢水北。\n遂尔款津涯，净然见胸臆。\n高谈悬物象，逸韵投翰墨。\n别岸迥无垠，海鹤鸣不息。\n梁城多古意，携手共凄恻。\n怀贤想邹枚，登高思荆棘。\n世情恶疵贱，之子怜孤直。\n酬赠感幷深，离忧岂终极。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}